  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehosafati akarara ase chisokoro chiaye chiaraarete, agatindekwa ase Omochie o Daudi, ase chisokoro chiaye chiatindegetwe, na Yehoramu, omwana oye omomura, akaba okogamba ase ribaga riaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu omorwoti bw’Abayuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 8:17-24)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu nabwate abamura bamwabo, abana ba Yehosafati: Asaria na Yehieli, Zakaria na Asariahu, Mikaeli na Sefatia. Aba bonsi nigo barenge basinto ba Yehosafati, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ise akabaa ebiegwa ebinene, chifeta ne chitaabu, ne chinibo chie rigori rinene, amo nemechie y’Abayuda yagiteire chindwaki; korende akaa Yehoramu oborwoti, ekiagera nere orenge omomura omotangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yehoramu airete oborwoti bwa ise, na kanyorire chinguru ase borobwo, agaita abamura bamwabo bonsi n’omoro, boigo agaita abanene bande b’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo etato, na ebere, ekero abeete omorwoti; akagamba emiaka etano na etato, agwo Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabwatia chinchera chi’abarwoti b’Abaisraeli, buna abanto b’enyomba y’Ahabu bakorete, ekiagera ere nigo anyuomete omoiseke o Ahabu. Agakora ayare amabe ase obosio bw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nonya naboigo, Omonene tanchete gosiria enyomba ya Daudi, ekiagera nakorete okobwatana kw’ogotianania na Daudi, naende nariete eira ng’a Daudi abe etaya ekomoreka botambe kogenderera, ere amo nororeria rwaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yehoramu arenge kogamba, Abaedomu bagasaria, bakaanga kogamberwa n’Abayuda, bakebekera omorwoti obo abanyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu akagenda amo nabatang’ani baye b’abasikari, ne chigari chiaye chionsi. Ase obotuko boria akarwania Abaedomu abwo konya bamoetananire ase arenge, akabaita amo nabachiki babo be chigari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo Abaedomu bagasaria bakaanga kogamberwa n’Abayuda; naboigo ere goika reero iga. Ase engaki eria abanto b’omochie o Libuna boigo bagasaria, bakaanga kogamberwa na Yehoramu, ekiagera ere atigete Omonene, Nyasae bwe chisokoro chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaroisia aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa agwo ase ense y’ebigoro bia Yuda, naende akagera abanto bamenyete Yerusalemu bakaba abategenwa, na akagera Abayuda bagatiga chinchera chindonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija omobani agatomera Yehoramu riruube rigoteeba, “Aya nar’Omonene, Nyasae o Daudi sokoro yao, agoteeba: Aye tobwateti chinchera chia Yehosafati iso, gose echi’Asa, omorwoti bw’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ribaga ri’ayio kwabwatirie chinchera chi’abarwoti b’Abaisraeli, na kwagerire Abayuda na abanto bamenyete Yerusalemu babeire batari abegenwa, buna abanto b’enyomba y’Ahabu bagerete Abaisraeli tibaaba abegenwa. Naende gwaitire abamura bamino, aba barenge ase enyomba ya iso, na barenge abaya gokobua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rora Omonene narente amaakwa amanene igoro ase abanto bao, na ase abana bao, na ase abakungu bao, na enibo yao yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omonyene nonyore oborwaire obobe bw’enda goika amara ao abe agosoka isiko ase engencho y’oborwaire obwo, rituko ase rituko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agasukia Abafirisiti na Abaarabu, abwo bare ang’e n’Abaetiopia, bakarwania Yehoramu esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagenda ase ense y’Abayuda, bagasoa aroro, bagasakora chinibo chionsi chi’enyomba y’omorwoti, bakaira na abana baye abamura, na abakungu baye, tibatigete nonya nomwana omomura oyomo otatiga Yehoahasi, oria orenge omoke ase abana baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio onsi Omonene agaaka Yehoramu noborwaire bw’enda botarenge kogwenigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amatuko atari make, ase omoerio bw’omwaka o kabere, amara aye agasoka ase engencho y’oborwaire boria; ere agakwa ase ogochandeka kw’obororo obonene. Abanto tibautete omorero bw’okworokia amasikani ase engencho yaye, buna bakorete ase engencho ye chisokoro chiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoramu nigo arenge nemiaka emerongo etato na ebere, ekero achagete kogamba, na akagamba emiaka etano na etato, agwo Yerusalemu. Ekero akwete, omonto onde tamoichanerete. Abanto bakamotindeka ase Omochie o Daudi, korende tari ase chimbeera chi’abarwoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
